Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:25:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD review-completion confirmation prompts to preserve
 review-ready focus

Clean review results leave the patch chat in a confirmation state. Yes closes locally without resuming the agent, while no or later work reopens the chat and resumes the normal send flow.
